ocal.common_tags,\n    {\n      Name = \"${var.project_name}-private-subnet-${count.index + 1}\"\n      Type = \"Private\"\n    }\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**Key differences:**\n- `map_public_ip_on_launch = true` for public subnets (EC2s get public IPs automatically)\n- Separate resources for public vs private\n- Type tag for easy identification\n\n**Ready to add this?** Type it out or should I help you understand any part first? 🎯"
